<p>Cheers to my second SCP article. I'm much happier with how this one turned out than with my first.</p>
<p>For some inexplicable reason, I imagine this humanoid SCP sounding exactly like Jacksepticeye.</p>
<p>Thank you to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lazar-lyusternik" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2326669); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2326669&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1500667797" alt="Lazar Lyusternik" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2326669)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lazar-lyusternik" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2326669); return false;">Lazar Lyusternik</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1581620); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1581620&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1500667797" alt="DarkStuff" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1581620)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1581620); return false;">DarkStuff</a></span> for giving feedback when this was a concept and to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3075960); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3075960&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1500667797" alt="stormbreath" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3075960)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3075960); return false;">stormbreath</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/orsinia" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3178879); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3178879&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1500667797" alt="Orsinia" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/user